# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/ship-4 window (the combined ship candidate; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/ship-4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-ship-4/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# TQ1 (SOFT, GATE ONLY): the per-tenant quota gate (c2_prefix_gate.py --plan tier-quota; docs/prefix-store-hygiene.md "Tenant quotas") on the audited twin
# c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-audit. THE QUOTAS ARE NOT IN THE CANDIDATE (the contract refuses QWEN_PREFIX_TENANT_QUOTA_* on a traffic profile until
# a qualification record exists); this job keeps the gate-only evidence current on the combined stack, so that a later quota decision does not need another window. Two
# arms, two boots, the same scenario as the tier pack's TQ1 (references/fusion-jobs/tier/TQ1-tier-quota-isolation.env has the full read: both arms PASS, tenant B's return a
# device-resident hit on quota-isolated and not on quota-control, the quota's own evictions on the books, quota_dev_floor_overrides 0, the failure counters zero, all four
# pairs IDENTICAL, then python3 scripts/ci/tier_concurrent_compare.py --quota <results>/quota-control <results>/quota-isolated). The flood is the 16,500-block pool. Lowest
# value of the window; cut it first. Duration (estimate): 120 minutes.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-ship-4
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=tier-quota
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_BOX_MINUTES=240
